SUMMARY:Award Winning Documentary - Unbroken: the Untold Story of Shen Yun
DESCRIPTION:Meet us at the Davis Public Library! Join us in viewing the story of a group of young artists coming of age as they discover what it means to stand for something greater than themselves. Unbroken reveals how a smear campaign linked to the Chinese regime seeks to exploit America’s freedoms to threaten artists and silence their work. \nSaturday 11/21\, 10:00AM–11:30PM\nDavis Public Library (315 E. 14th Street\, Davis)\nLight refreshments will be served. \nCan’t join us on that day? watch movie FREE at NTDfilms.com.
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/award-winning-documentary-unbroken-the-untold-story-of-shen-yun/
