SUMMARY:Monthly Swing Dance
DESCRIPTION:Visit Davis Arts Center every month for a swing dance social! If you’ve never done swing dancing\, don’t worry! Drop into the beginner lesson at 6pm to learn swing dance basics. Then\, you are welcome to stick around and practice your new dance moves during the social. Open to adults\, whether you are an experienced dancer or have never set foot on a dance floor! \nAll skill levels welcome. No dance partner needed.\n$5 beginner lesson @ 6pm-7pm\n$10 social dance @ 7pm-9pm \nInstructor: Karolos Notis \nAge(s): 18+ \nDate: Saturday\, November 21\, 2026 \nTime: 6pm-9pm \n 
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/monthly-swing-dance/
LOCATION:Davis Arts Center\, 1919 F St\, Davis\, 95616\, United States
CATEGORIES:Stage & Dance
